cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use sailboat-hydro or the Nordic sailboat benchmark, please cite FairHelm and the Zenodo DOI."
title: "sailboat-hydro"
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Nareyko
    given-names: Vadim
    affiliation: FairHelm
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23374417
url: https://fairhelm.com/en/yachts/formulas/
repository-code: https://github.com/nareyko/sailboat-hydro
abstract: >-
  Python library for FairHelm sailboat hydrodynamic formulas (hull speed,
  capsize screening, displacement/length, comfort ratio, sail area/displacement)
  and a bundled Open European & Nordic Sailboat Benchmark of 93 models.
  Zero-Network: formulas and data ship inside the package with no HTTP to
  api.fairhelm.com.
keywords:
  - sailboat
  - yacht
  - hydrodynamics
  - fairhelm
  - nordic
